---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Contact Orlisia" description="Get in touch with Orlisia.">
  <div class="category-header">
    <div class="breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a> &raquo; <span>Contact</span>
    </div>
    <h1>Contact</h1>
    <p>Editorial, corrections, and tip submissions.</p>
  </div>

  <article class="article-single">
    <h2>Editorial inquiries</h2>
    <p>For story tips, expert sources, or pitches, send a short note describing the topic, why it matters now, and any primary sources you have in mind.</p>

    <h2>Corrections</h2>
    <p>If you spot an error in any guide — a wrong price, a misattributed product, an outdated recommendation — please flag it. Corrections are noted at the end of each updated article.</p>

    <h2>Partnerships</h2>
    <p>We do not currently run display advertising or sponsored content. Affiliate partnerships where Orlisia earns a small commission on qualified purchases are disclosed inline and at the foot of each affected article.</p>

    <h2>Response time</h2>
    <p>We aim to acknowledge notes within seven days. We cannot promise coverage or placement for any submission.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
